        <p>QT. GEORGE'S IRON WORKS. LIMITHD (late Ormerod, /1/43 Grierson and Co.), Hulme. Manchester, have the Largest Assortment of WHEEL and' PULLEY PATTERNS in the trade. In addition have purchase 4 all Wheel, Pri!ey and Tooth Block Patterns tic., telonglng to the late Henry Wren and Co., Londorproad Iron Works, Manchester, an are in a position to Supply CASTINGS, Millwright,and a klr ds of Engineering Work Promptly.—Catalogues Wheels and Pulley Patterns on application. 21. T., No. 229, Manchester: Telegraphic address: " Ormerod Grierson, Manchester.'</p>
        <p>TRAP FOR SALE, in good order with cushions and lamps. J. —Apply, 22, MERSEY RD., Widnes.</p>
        <p>BUSINBSS TRAP (good), must sell; cheap.—lomi HALLOWS, Henry et., Church, nr Accrington.</p>
