        <p>lANFORD'S POISON for Killing Rats answers kJ well. "After one dressing I found 135 dead next morn Ing."—J. Buss, Helsthorpe, Leighton. " I killed 20) rats with Sanford's Poison."—C. Coos, Farmer, Rliesmere. " I stroyed 145 rats with it."—C. WlLsov. Orford.—ien dill 2d SANFORD &amp; SON, Sandy, Bedc Sold by Chemists</p>
