        <p>T. Hackett J. Ditchfield W. Stephenson F. Millar l5 W. Eyes ll W. Mees S. Davies, a bye. SIXTH ROUND. F. Millar W. Mees W. Stephenson ............ n J. Ditchfield l2 SEMI-FINAL.</p>
