      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1904-10-01_WidnesExaminer_art0116" n="art0116">
        <head>SORE FEET</head>
        <p>SORE FEET</p>
        <p>Inflamed, Itching, Burning, Sore, Tender and Perspiring,</p>
